WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.569
The year 2020 brings with it a host of new
TV options, from broadcast thrillers to Disney

00:00:05.569 --> 00:00:10.040
Plus franchises, and a great many of them
are set to scratch your science fiction itch.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.889
Whether you're watching traditional TV or
binge watching your heart out on your favorite

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:18.080
streaming service, here are the sci-fi shows
to watch out for in 2020.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:23.080
Snowpiercer took a long journey on its way
to a television debut, and it was almost as

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.140
wild and dramatic behind the scenes as the
story being told on the show.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:32.160
The series is based on the 2013 film of the
same name, directed by Academy Award winner

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.020
Bong Joon-ho and starring Chris Evans and
Tilda Swinton, which was itself adapted from

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.920
the French graphic novel that debuted in 1982.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.800
The TV development saga, meanwhile, dates
all the way back to 2015.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.380
In the time since, the series has seen its
original showrunner exit, its original pilot

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:53.410
director refuse to come back for reshoots,
and had its network changed from TNT to TBS

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.600
and then back to TNT.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:59.520
It's been a long ride, but now, Snowpiercer
is finally ready to depart on its television

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.020
voyage.

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.540
The Snowpiercer series is, like the film and
graphic novel, set several years after the

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.470
world has been enveloped in ice and rendered
uninhabitable.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:12.540
Viewers will follow the residents of a massive
locomotive as it circles the snowbound world,

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:16.750
with the focus on the various class struggles
and schemes within the crude society that's

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.880
sprung up among the remnants of humanity.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:23.380
Starring Hamilton's Daveed Diggs and Oscar
winner Jennifer Connelly, Snowpiercer will

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:26.840
finally debut on TNT on May 31, 2020.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:32.240
For the last eight years, Dark Horse Comics
has been home to Peter Hogan and Steve Parkhouse's

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.260
Resident Alien.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:37.219
The comic book series centers on an alien
from outer space who's forced to hide out

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:40.760
in a small town while he waits for someone
from his species to come and pick him up.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:46.840
Since 2018, SYFY has been developing a TV
series based on the comics, and in 2020 we'll

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.900
finally get to see the fruits of that labor.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:54.680
Resident Alien stars Alan Tudyk as the title
alien, who adopts the human name Harry Vanderspiegle.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:59.620
After finding himself stranded on Earth, Harry
decides to take on a human disguise and pose

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.800
as a doctor in a small Colorado town.

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:05.880
That's all complicated enough, but life gets
a little harder for Harry when he's roped

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.460
into a series of mysteries he must help to
solve.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:12.480
Oh, and there's one kid in the town who can
see right through his human disguise.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:16.060
Resident Alien will premiere on SYFY in the
summer of 2020.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.480
The vast collection of shows and characters
known to fans as the Arrowverse just keeps

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:26.409
expanding over at the CW. 2020 sees the flagship
series that launched the small-screen universe,

00:02:26.409 --> 00:02:31.319
Arrow, ending its run after the death of Oliver
Queen in the "Crisis on Infinite Earths" crossover,

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:34.580
but that just means there's more room in the
schedule for future series.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:38.440
Thankfully for fans who've been eager to see
more of them, some of that room is going to

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.760
be taken up by the Arrowverse's all-new Superman
and Lois Lane.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:46.010
The most prevalent version of Superman in
this universe, played by Tyler Hoechlin, first

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:50.750
popped up on Supergirl, while his version
of Lois Lane, played by Elizabeth Tulloch,

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.330
debuted in the "Elseworlds" crossover event
in December of 2018.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:58.930
In October of 2019, the CW announced that
it was developing a spinoff series that would

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:03.620
center on Hoechlin's Superman and Tulloch's
Lois, fulfilling a longstanding fan wish for

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.080
a new TV series about the Couple of Steel.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:10.840
Superman &amp; Lois does not yet have a premiere
date, but we'll likely see it arriving sometime

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.220
in the fall of 2020.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:17.480
Steve Carell became a global superstar thanks
to his starring role in The Office, a workplace

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:22.780
comedy series that led to numerous opportunities
as a film actor in both comedy and drama.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:27.920
In 2020, Carell is returning to the workplace,
and he's bringing Office writer Greg Daniels

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:28.720
along for the ride.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:33.340
Space Force, co-created by Carell and Daniels,
will follow a group of government employees

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:37.240
as they try to develop the sixth branch of
the United States Armed Forces.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.860
Carell will play a general trying to lead
the Space Force in its mission to get back

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.380
to the moon by 2024.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:47.610
Carell is joined on the mission by an incredible
ensemble cast, including The Americans' Noah

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:51.799
Emmerich, Sonic the Hedgehog's Ben Schwartz,
and John Malkovich, another actor who's brilliant

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.360
at both comedy and drama.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.900
With Carell starring as well as co-creating
the series, we can expect plenty of Office-level

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.520
gags along the way when Space Force hits Netflix
in 2020.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:07.360
In the spring of 2019, Avengers: Endgame ended
a decade-long era of storytelling in the Marvel

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:10.840
Cinematic Universe with a climactic battle
for the fate of all existence.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.440
It also set the stage for the next phase of
stories in the MCU.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.580
We're only just beginning to see what comes
next, but we do know a lot of it will unfold

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:22.680
on the Disney Plus streaming service, through
shows like The Falcon and the Winter Soldier.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:27.280
At the end of Endgame, Steve Rogers passed
Captain America's shield on to his friend

00:04:27.289 --> 00:04:31.830
Sam Wilson, better known as Falcon, with the
blessing of Steve's best friend Bucky Barnes,

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.260
a.k.a. the Winter Soldier.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:37.620
The upcoming Disney series will explore the
aftermath of that decision, as Sam contends

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.940
with the legacy he's now a part of with a
little help from Bucky.

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:45.220
The series will also feature the return of
Helmut Zemo from Captain America: Civil War

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:49.889
and Sharon Carter to the MCU, as well as the
live-action debut of Captain America knockoff

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:50.880
U.S. Agent.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:55.700
The Falcon and the Winter Soldier will arrive
on D+ sometime in late 2020.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:05:00.780
The events of Avengers: Infinity War and Avengers:
Endgame also had a major impact on the lives

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.200
of Vision and Scarlet Witch.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:06.730
The battle with Thanos left Vision apparently
dead and his lover mourning him, but the pair

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:11.000
are set to be reunited in WandaVision, a new
Disney Plus series that will somehow trap

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.139
the two heroes in a condensed history of television
sitcoms.

00:05:14.139 --> 00:05:18.819
Exactly how and why that happens is the mystery
that we're left with after the teaser, but

00:05:18.819 --> 00:05:22.240
we do know that a few familiar faces will
be back in action for the show.

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:26.610
Teyonah Parris has joined the series as an
adult version of Monica Rambeau, the longtime

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.820
comic book hero who first appeared as a child
in Captain Marvel.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:34.860
The series will also re-introduce Thor supporting
character Darcy Lewis, played by Kat Dennings,

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.620
to the MCU when it hits Disney Plus some time
in 2020.

